<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-στίλβω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεστίλβεσκε</span> Epic. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
			7.7
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be bright
				from</i> or <i>with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστίλβοντες ἀλείφατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.408
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				253
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐθείραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				47
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>JTr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					2.1.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνεται τὸ ὕδωρ ἀποστίλβον τῆς
					νυκτός</span>”
				<i>phosphorescent,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					370a14
				</span></i>
			; <i>shine brightly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				95
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				14.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτις</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἰς πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>shed</i> light, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μήνη σέλας -ουσα κεραίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					5.165
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαρότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					2.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
